---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | One Take Wonder Marketing"
  description="Boutique full-service marketing agency founded by Palloma Earl. 10+ years of experience in strategy, media, and creative. Based in Orlando, FL."
  canonical="about"
>
  <script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "@id": "https://onetakewondermarketing.com/about#faq", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you only work with businesses in Orlando?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "No. We are headquartered in Orlando and know Central Florida well, which helps when a campaign depends on local media and local audiences. But media buying and digital work are not limited by geography, and we run campaigns for clients across the United States. If your market is somewhere we have not bought before, we will say so and do the research before we spend your money in it."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What does “boutique” actually mean for a client?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "It means you talk to the person doing the work rather than an account manager relaying messages. It also means we take on a limited number of clients at a time, so there is a real ceiling on how many we can serve well. Practically, it shows up in small things: we do not bill for a phone call, and you are not waiting three days for an answer that takes five minutes."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do I have to use every service you offer?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Not at all. Most clients start with one or two things — often media buying or paid search — and add others only when there is a reason to. Being full-service means the capability is there when your plan needs it, not that you are sold all of it up front. We would rather run two channels properly than spread a budget across six."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What industries do you have experience in?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Our founder's background spans national advertising in Brazil and then television and media strategy at Univision, CBS and NBC affiliate stations, so broadcast and streaming are home ground. As an agency we work mostly with local and growing businesses across service, retail, hospitality and professional categories. If we are not the right fit for your category, we will tell you rather than learn on your budget."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do we get started?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "A conversation, not a contract. The first call is about understanding your business, what you have already tried and what has and has not worked. From there we put together a free, no-obligation proposal with a recommended approach and a budget. You decide whether it makes sense."}}]})} />

<!-- Page Hero -->
<section class="bg-gray-900 py-20 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center">
    <p class="text-brand-pink-light font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-4">About Us</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">Big-Agency Expertise, <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-pink-light to-brand-pink bg-clip-text text-transparent">Boutique-Level Care</span></h1>
    <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Based in Orlando, Florida, we bring strategy, creativity, media, and technology together under one roof — so your marketing works as hard as you do.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Our Story -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label">Our Story</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-8">Built <span class="gradient-text">Differently</span> From the Start</h2>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-500 space-y-5">
      <p>
        At One Take Wonder Marketing, we believe great marketing happens when strategy, creativity, media, and technology work together seamlessly. That belief is what inspired our founder, Palloma Earl, to create an agency designed differently from traditional firms — one that delivers big-agency expertise with boutique-level attention and care.
      </p>
      <p>
        With more than 20 years of experience in the marketing and advertising industry, Palloma has built her career helping brands connect with the right audiences through strategic planning, media expertise, and measurable growth. She began her career in Brazil, working at national advertising agencies and managing campaigns for nationally recognized accounts.
      </p>
      <p>
        After moving to the United States, Palloma followed her passion for media strategy and joined leading media organizations including Univision, CBS, and NBC affiliate stations, where she gained extensive experience across television, advertising, audience strategy, and integrated marketing solutions.
      </p>
      <p>
        Over the years, she realized many local and growing businesses faced a common challenge: they either had access to creative support without media expertise, or media buying without strategic alignment. Large agencies often came with high overhead costs and limited personalization. Palloma saw an opportunity to create something different — a boutique agency that brings strategy, creative, media, and execution together under one roof.
      </p>
      <p>
        That vision became One Take Wonder Marketing.
      </p>
      <p>
        Headquartered in Orlando, Florida, we serve local businesses across the region and nationwide — combining big-agency capabilities with the personal touch and local understanding that only a boutique firm can offer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- How We Work -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label">How We Work</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-8">Intentionally <span class="gradient-text">Boutique</span></h2>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-500 space-y-5">
      <p>
        Today, we remain intentionally boutique. We carefully select the businesses we partner with so every client receives personalized attention, strategic direction, and direct access to experienced professionals invested in their success. Being boutique also means we can offer the best cost benefits for our clients — unlike big agencies with high overhead, we don't charge by the hour for every conversation or email. We're built to be budget-friendly without sacrificing quality.
      </p>
      <p>
        Behind the scenes, we collaborate with a trusted network of media strategists, creative specialists, production partners, and marketing experts who help bring each campaign to life. This extended team allows us to offer the resources and capabilities of a larger agency while maintaining the responsiveness, flexibility, and personal connection of a boutique firm.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Leadership -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label">Our Team</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-8">Decades of Experience, <span class="gradient-text">Working Together</span></h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
      <!-- Palloma -->
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100">
        <img src="/palloma.jpg" alt="Palloma Earl" class="w-full h-80 object-cover object-[center_20%]" />
        <div class="p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Palloma Earl</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-pink text-sm font-medium mb-4">Founder & Marketing Strategist</p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            With over 20 years in marketing and advertising — across national agencies in Brazil and major U.S. media organizations including Univision, CBS, and NBC — Palloma brings deep expertise in strategy, media planning, and integrated marketing. She leads every client relationship personally.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Josiah -->
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100">
        <img src="/josiah.jpg" alt="Josiah Earl" class="w-full h-80 object-cover object-[center_20%]" />
        <div class="p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Josiah Earl</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-pink text-sm font-medium mb-4">Technology & Innovation Partner</p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            With extensive experience as a Lead Systems Engineer supporting global organizations, Josiah brings advanced technology and digital innovation into our marketing solutions. From campaign optimization and website performance to search engine strategy and emerging AI-driven tools, he helps ensure our clients benefit from modern, efficient, and scalable marketing solutions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl p-10 text-center">
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Together, we combine decades of experience in strategy, media, creativity, and technology — supported by an extended team of talented specialists — to help businesses grow with confidence through customized marketing solutions built around results, relationships, and long-term success.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label">Common Questions</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-10">Questions We <span class="gradient-text">Hear Often</span></h2>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Do you only work with businesses in Orlando?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg leading-relaxed">No. We are headquartered in Orlando and know Central Florida well, which helps when a campaign depends on local media and local audiences. But media buying and digital work are not limited by geography, and we run campaigns for clients across the United States. If your market is somewhere we have not bought before, we will say so and do the research before we spend your money in it.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">What does “boutique” actually mean for a client?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg leading-relaxed">It means you talk to the person doing the work rather than an account manager relaying messages. It also means we take on a limited number of clients at a time, so there is a real ceiling on how many we can serve well. Practically, it shows up in small things: we do not bill for a phone call, and you are not waiting three days for an answer that takes five minutes.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Do I have to use every service you offer?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg leading-relaxed">Not at all. Most clients start with one or two things — often media buying or paid search — and add others only when there is a reason to. Being full-service means the capability is there when your plan needs it, not that you are sold all of it up front. We would rather run two channels properly than spread a budget across six.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">What industries do you have experience in?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg leading-relaxed">Our founder's background spans national advertising in Brazil and then television and media strategy at Univision, CBS and NBC affiliate stations, so broadcast and streaming are home ground. As an agency we work mostly with local and growing businesses across service, retail, hospitality and professional categories. If we are not the right fit for your category, we will tell you rather than learn on your budget.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">How do we get started?</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg leading-relaxed">A conversation, not a contract. The first call is about understanding your business, what you have already tried and what has and has not worked. From there we put together a free, no-obligation proposal with a recommended approach and a budget. You decide whether it makes sense.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="py-20 px-6 bg-gray-900">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">
      Ready to Work With a Team <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-pink-light to-brand-pink bg-clip-text text-transparent">Invested in Your Success?</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-10">
      Let's talk about your goals. We'll put together a free, no-obligation proposal tailored to your business.
    </p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary text-lg !px-10 !py-4">Let's chat!</a>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
